WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.397
Hi there, and welcome to ResDish! Local restaurants across the United States and Canada post their surplus food, like wrong orders and end-of-day extras, at up to seventy percent off.

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:18.592
Create a free account with your ZIP code, or your postal code in Canada, then log in with your email or user name.

00:00:18.892 --> 00:00:25.101
You'll see the live deals closest to your ZIP code first, with a countdown showing how long each one is available.

00:00:25.404 --> 00:00:29.073
Search by dish, restaurant, city, or ZIP or postal code.

00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:31.593
Pick a deal, and choose how many you want.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:37.870
You see the full total before you order: the food, a small service fee, and any applicable taxes.

00:00:38.174 --> 00:00:43.272
Got a coupon from ResDish? Enter the code, and the discount comes right off your total.

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:47.614
Use your ResDish credit, and pay the rest with a saved or new card.

00:00:51.238 --> 00:00:55.227
Your card is only held for now. It's charged when you pick up your food.

00:00:56.071 --> 00:00:59.803
Done! You get a four-digit PIN. Show it at the counter when you pick up.

00:01:01.931 --> 00:01:04.831
Your orders and PINs are always under My orders.

00:01:05.793 --> 00:01:09.206
And every order comes with a receipt you can print or download.

00:01:09.647 --> 00:01:14.554
Here's how it works in real life. Sam orders dinner on his phone, and gets his PIN.

00:01:16.123 --> 00:01:19.963
Then he drives over to the restaurant, before the pickup window closes.

00:01:24.325 --> 00:01:30.960
At the counter, he shows his PIN. The staff check it and hand over his food, and only then is his card charged.

00:01:34.536 --> 00:01:38.824
That's ResDish. Rescue great food, and save money. Happy rescuing!
